OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day, with plenty
OL,6,Fof sunny spells. The sunshine turning
OL,7,Fhazy through the afternoon, with the
OL,8,Fincreasing chance of an isolated
OL,9,Fshower in the east. Another warm and
OL,10,Fhumid feeling day, with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSunny spells through the
OL,13,Fevening, but a few showers are
OL,14,Fpossible. Mostly dry overnight, with
OL,15,Fany showers tending to fade as we head
OL,16,Ftowards dawn. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
